Subject: [PATCH] ssdk: preserve MIB error state and complete cumulative diagnostics

Keep the hardware read, software accumulation and counter output under the
existing FAL lock without recursively entering a public getter. Preserve
counters on failed reads/flushes, include both jumbo error fields, and return
GMAC swconfig read/reset failures instead of reporting stale values as health.
Periodic failures are rate limited; this changes diagnostics, not forwarding.

Based on QSDK 13.1.r2 d9a196497ecee2530722d906e0efe1b7408b6ef6.
XGMAC combined-read semantics and actual hardware validation remain separate.

